<title>REPUBLIC OF IRELAND: Ireland's NTMA sets 100 mln punt tap in 5-yr bond.</title>
<headline>Ireland's NTMA sets 100 mln punt tap in 5-yr bond.</headline>
<dateline>DUBLIN 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ireland's National Treasury Management Agency (NTMA) on Tuesday set a 100 million punt tap issue in the 6.5 percent bond due 2001.</p>
</text>
